0:{"buildId":"7TV3WSDnKGdgKVGmLMU3E","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Visa"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"6 THINGS TO DO AFTER YOUR VISA IS APPROVED"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"Getting your visa approved is a long process. And the real struggles starts after your visa gets approved. You would have so much on your plate to deal with and you will be confused with so many questions rushing in your head. Like, where to start? How to start? What to do? Etc. There will be complete chaos in your mind. The only solution is to “Divide and Plan”. Divide and categorize your work while keeping in mind that which should be addressed first and prioritize accordingly and then plan your strategy. Here are some things mentioned to do after your visa is approved. Top 6 things to do after your visa is approved:-"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","Book your flight tickets:-",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Book your flight tickets:-"}],[["$","p","Get done with booking your flight tickets as soon as possible. As , the prices are always fluctuating. Delaying your tickets to the last is a bad option. So, pre-book your tickets early so that it can help you save a ton.",{"children":"Get done with booking your flight tickets as soon as possible. As , the prices are always fluctuating. Delaying your tickets to the last is a bad option. So, pre-book your tickets early so that it can help you save a ton."}],["$","p","Finding a right accommodation abroad isn’t a piece of cake. If you need your comfort-satisfactory-home type accommodation you have to go an extra mile before you even reach there.",{"children":"Finding a right accommodation abroad isn’t a piece of cake. If you need your comfort-satisfactory-home type accommodation you have to go an extra mile before you even reach there."}],["$","p","As easy going it seems it isn’t , you have to research,check,talk it out and fix. There are several type of accommodation you can check for like",{"children":"As easy going it seems it isn’t , you have to research,check,talk it out and fix. There are several type of accommodation you can check for like"}],["$","p","(studio apartments,hostels,PG’s,university housing,lofts)",{"children":"(studio apartments,hostels,PG’s,university housing,lofts)"}],["$","p","Also read (our accommodation blog)",{"children":"Also read (our accommodation blog)"}],["$","p","*Note*-",{"children":"*Note*-"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Accommodation:-",{"children":"Accommodation:-"}]]}]]}],["$","section","‘watch out for the fraud site’s which can con you into loosing your personal details and ton of amount’",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"‘watch out for the fraud site’s which can con you into loosing your personal details and ton of amount’"}],[],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Pay your tuition fee:- As your admission is confirmed , you have to pay some initial deposit or 1st installment to the university you chose. Delaying the fee payment could even mean your admission getting cancelled, a situation you would want to avoid at any cost.",{"children":"Pay your tuition fee:- As your admission is confirmed , you have to pay some initial deposit or 1st installment to the university you chose. Delaying the fee payment could even mean your admission getting cancelled, a situation you would want to avoid at any cost."}]]}]]}],"$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8"]}],"$L9"]}]}],"$La"]}],["$Lb"],"$Lc"]}],"isPartial":"$@d","staleTime":"$e","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Lf","isPartial":"$@10","staleTime":"$e","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L11","isPartial":"$@12","staleTime":"$e","varyParams":"$13"},{"rsc":"$L14","isPartial":"$@15","staleTime":"$e","varyParams":"$13"},{"rsc":"$L16","isPartial":"$@17","staleTime":"$e","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@18","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@19"}
